#. Attribute `sentry.action` metadata description from @sentry/conventions
msgid ""
"Used as a generic attribute representing the action depending on the type "
"of span. For instance, this is the database query operation for DB spans, "
"and the request method for HTTP spans."
msgstr ""
"Used as a genyewic attwibute wepwesenting da action depending on da type of "
"span. Fow instance, this is da database quewy opewation fow DB spans, and "
"da wequest method fow HTTP spans."

#. Attribute `sentry.domain` metadata description from @sentry/conventions
msgid ""
"Used as a generic attribute representing the domain depending on the type "
"of span. For instance, this is the collection/table name for database "
"spans, and the server address for HTTP spans."
msgstr ""
"Used as a genyewic attwibute wepwesenting da domain depending on da type of "
"span. Fow instance, this is da cowwection/tabwe nyame fow database spans, "
"and da sewvew addwess fow HTTP spans."

#. Attribute `sentry.normalized_description` metadata description from @sentry/conventions
msgid ""
"Used as a generic attribute representing the normalized "
"`sentry.description`. This refers to the legacy use case of "
"`sentry.description` where it holds relevant data depending on the type of "
"span (e.g. database query, resource url, http request description, etc)."
msgstr ""
"Used as a genyewic attwibute wepwesenting da nyowmawized "
"`sentwy.descwiption`. This wefews to da wegacy use case of "
"`sentwy.descwiption` whewe it howds wewevant data depending on da type of "
"span (e.g. database quewy, wesouwce uww, http wequest descwiption, etc)."

#. Attribute `sentry.kind` metadata description from @sentry/conventions
msgid ""
"Used to clarify the relationship between parents and children, or to "
"distinguish between spans, e.g. a `server` and `client` span with the same "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Used to cwawify da wewationship between pawents and chiwdwen, ow to "
"distinguish between spans, e.g. a `sewvew` and `cwient` span with da same "
"nyame."

#. Attribute `ai.presence_penalty` metadata description from @sentry/conventions
msgid ""
"Used to reduce repetitiveness of generated tokens. Similar to "
"frequency_penalty, except that this penalty is applied equally to all "
"tokens that have already appeared, regardless of their exact frequencies."
msgstr ""
"Used to weduce wepetitivenyess of genyewated tokens. Simiwaw to "
"fwequency_penyawty, except that this penyawty is appwied equawwy to aww "
"tokens that haz awweady appeawed, wegawdwess of t-theiw exact fwequencies."

#. Attribute `ai.frequency_penalty` metadata description from @sentry/conventions
msgid ""
"Used to reduce repetitiveness of generated tokens. The higher the value, "
"the stronger a penalty is applied to previously present tokens, "
"proportional to how many times they have already appeared in the prompt or "
"prior generation."
msgstr ""
"Used to weduce wepetitivenyess of genyewated tokens. Da highew da vawue, da "
"stwongew a penyawty is appwied to pweviouswy pwesent tokens, pwopowtionyaw "
"to how many times they haz awweady appeawed in da pwompt ow pwiow "
"genyewation."

